  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich strong { color: #20262B; }
  .rich a { color: #1F7A8C; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .rich a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<!-- HERO -->
<section style="position:relative;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;overflow:hidden;">
  <img src="/images/hero-panorama.webp" alt="St. John's and the Avalon Peninsula landscape" width="2000" height="950" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,61,92,0.55) 0%, rgba(10,61,92,0.25) 55%, rgba(10,61,92,0.45) 100%);"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;max-width:880px;padding:96px 24px 130px;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:18px;padding:7px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);">Licensed &amp; Insured · St. John's and the Avalon Peninsula</span>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.015em;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px);margin:0 0 18px;text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(10,61,92,0.45);">Oil Tank Replacement in St. John's, Swapped Before the Truck Says No</h1>
    <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 30px;text-shadow:0 1px 12px rgba(10,61,92,0.5);">Harbour Tank Co replaces and removes home heating oil tanks across the Northeast Avalon, Conception Bay South and Conception Bay North. Same-week swaps, a 24/7 line for expired-tag and leaking-tank emergencies, and every estimate is free and in writing.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="tel:+17098003117" class="btn-green" style="font-size:15px;padding:16px 38px;">Call Now — (709) 800-3117</a>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-white-outline" style="font-size:15px;">Get My Free Written Estimate</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <svg class="swoosh" style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,70 C360,10 1080,10 1440,70 L1440,70 L0,70 Z" fill="#ffffff"/></svg>
</section>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section style="padding:100px 24px 64px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="intro-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div style="position:relative;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(10,61,92,0.22);aspect-ratio:1/1;">
        <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="Harbour Tank Co service crew" width="1024" height="1024" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute;bottom:-18px;right:-14px;background:#C63D2F;color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(186,106,16,0.4);">
        <p style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin:0;line-height:1;">24/7</p>
        <p style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">Emergency Line</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Oil tank service in St. John's and the Avalon</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 18px;">Oil Tank Help From Folks Who Know a St. John's January</h2>
      <div class="rich"><p>Harbour Tank Co handles <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-st-johns/">oil tank replacement</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-removal-st-johns/">oil tank removal</a> for homes in St. John's and across the Avalon. Thousands of houses around the bay still heat with furnace oil, and every registered tank carries a HOST tag with a month and year stamped on it. When that month passes, the fuel company can't legally fill you, and that's usually the day the phone rings.</p><p>We keep it simple: a free written estimate, a same-week swap, and a licensed inspector to tag and register the new tank so deliveries can start again. A 200-gallon steel tank is $3,200 installed and <a href="/fibreglass-oil-tank-upgrade-st-johns/">fibreglass</a> is $3,850, both with the old tank hauled away. If you'd rather see the numbers before you call, our <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-cost/">cost guide</a> lays them all out, and if the driver has already turned you away, start with the <a href="/expired-oil-tank-emergency-st-johns/">emergency page</a>.</p></div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-blue" style="margin-top:10px;">More About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 44px !important; } }
</style>

<!-- TILES -->
<section id="services" style="padding:96px 24px 84px;background:#EDF4F4;">
  <div style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">Fast Emergency Service Available</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 40px;">What's Going On With Your Oil Tank?</h2>
    <div class="tile-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;">
      <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-1.webp" alt="New 200-gallon steel heating oil tank on a concrete pad beside a clapboard St. John's home" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Tag date is coming up</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/oil-tank-removal-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-2.webp" alt="Two workers wheeling an old rusty heating oil tank away from a house on a dolly" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Old tank has to go</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/fibreglass-oil-tank-upgrade-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-3.webp" alt="New green fibreglass oil tank installed outside a clapboard house on the Avalon coast" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Want a tank that outlasts you</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/expired-oil-tank-emergency-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-4.webp" alt="Service truck with work lights on at a snowy Newfoundland home at dusk" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Expired tag or a leak right now</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/how-to-read-host-tag/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-1.webp" alt="Close-up of a stamped metal HOST registration tag on an oil tank vent pipe with rust around it" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Can't read your HOST tag</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/oil-tank-leaking-what-to-do/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-2.webp" alt="Oil stain spreading across snow beneath an outdoor heating oil tank" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Oil on the snow under the tank</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/rust-on-oil-tank/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-3.webp" alt="Heavy rust and pitting on the lower shell of an old steel heating oil tank" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Rust flaking off the tank</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/oil-delivery-refused/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-4.webp" alt="Homeowner at a kitchen table reading a fuel delivery slip and an insurance letter" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;padding:14px 12px;">Driver wouldn't fill you</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .tile-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr) !important; } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .tile-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>

<!-- SERVICE CARDS -->
<section style="padding:0 24px 80px;background:#EDF4F4;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="svc-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Oil Tank Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">A new 200-gallon steel tank installed for $3,200, old tank hauled away, and a licensed inspector to tag and register it so the fuel truck can fill you. Most swaps are booked the same week you approve the estimate.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#C63D2F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/oil-tank-removal-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">An outdoor domestic tank drained, disconnected and gone for $500, lines capped and the site tidied. Indoor and basement tanks are quoted case by case once we've had a look at the stairs and the space.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#C63D2F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/fibreglass-oil-tank-upgrade-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Fibreglass & Double-Wall Tanks</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Fibreglass or Roth double-wall tanks are $3,850 installed and don't sit on the 10 to 25 year steel clock in NLR 60/03. The extra $650 over steel buys a tank you'll likely never replace again.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#C63D2F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/expired-oil-tank-emergency-st-johns/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Expired Tag & Leaking Tank Emergency</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">A refused delivery, a wet spot under the tank or an oil smell in the basement gets a real person on the phone any hour. We'll tell you what to do this minute and get a crew moving.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#C63D2F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
