<!-- WHY -->
<section style="padding:100px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">Straight Prices, No Surprises, Legal to Fill</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C63D2F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 4px;">The price is on paper before anyone shows up</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#55616B;margin:0;">We look at the tank, the lines and the pad, then put the number in writing. What you sign is what you pay unless you change the job.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C63D2F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Old tank removal is built into the install price</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#55616B;margin:0;">The $3,200 steel and $3,850 fibreglass prices include draining, disconnecting and hauling away the old tank. No disposal surprise at the end.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C63D2F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Tagged and registered so the truck can fill you</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#55616B;margin:0;">A licensed inspector tags the new system and registers it with the province. You get the confirmation of registration your insurer and your lawyer will ask for.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C63D2F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Same-week swaps, sooner if you're running dry</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#55616B;margin:0;">Once the estimate is approved we book you in that week. Already out of oil or turned away by the driver? Say so and you go to the front of the line.</p>
            </div>
