<!-- AREAS -->
<section style="padding:96px 24px 60px;background:#fff;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">Service Areas</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);margin:0 0 16px;">Serving St. John's and the Avalon Peninsula</h2>
    <div class="rich" style="text-align:left;"><p>We're based in St. John's and cover the Northeast Avalon, Conception Bay South and Conception Bay North. That takes in <a href="/oil-tank-service-mount-pearl/">Mount Pearl</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-service-paradise/">Paradise</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-service-conception-bay-south/">Conception Bay South</a> from Topsail out to Seal Cove, <a href="/oil-tank-service-torbay/">Torbay</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-service-portugal-cove-st-philips/">Portugal Cove-St. Philip's</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-service-bay-roberts/">Bay Roberts</a>, with Spaniard's Bay, Harbour Grace and Carbonear close by. If your town isn't on the list but it's on the Avalon, call anyway and we'll likely get to you.</p></div>
